sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Resident/Internal Admin
  participant W as Web portal
  participant API as Habitus API

  U->>W: Authenticate (valid credentials)
  W->>API: GET /me/memberships
  API-->>W: Condominiums + units the user belongs to
  alt More than one condominium and/or fraction
    W-->>U: Show fraction/condominium selector
    U->>W: Choose active condominium + fraction
    W->>API: POST /me/active-context {condominiumId, unitId}
    API-->>W: Token/claims scoped to selected context
  else Single membership
    W->>API: Adopt the only membership as active context
  end
  W-->>U: Load portal scoped to the active context
  Note over U,W: User can switch context later without re-login
